# Sitemaps are generated by the postbuild script on every build.
# Tracking them causes git pull to fail on the server after each deploy
# because the build regenerates them with a fresh lastmod date.
# CI reads them from the dist/ artefact (seo-gates depends on build).
public/sitemap.xml
public/sitemap-*.xml

